flowchart TD
    Q[User question] --> S[Resolve user + matter scope]
    S --> ACL[Filter permitted resources]
    ACL --> RET[Exact / semantic retrieval]
    RET --> CLS[Classification / boundary check]
    CLS --> CTX[Assemble cited context]
    CTX --> LLM[Model]
    LLM --> RESP[Answer + citations]
    LLM --> PLAN[Optional typed tool proposal]
    PLAN --> POL[Policy engine]
    POL -->|deny| DENY[Blocked action]
    POL -->|allow| APP{Approval required?}
    APP -->|yes| HUM[Human approval]
    APP -->|no| CAP[One-shot capability]
    HUM --> CAP
    CAP --> ACT[Restricted tool execution]
    ACT --> VER[Version + audit]
